config BR2_PACKAGE_NOVATEK_SENSORS
	bool "Novatek sensor drivers"
	depends on BR2_SOC_VENDOR_NOVATEK
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Image sensor driver for the camera's BR2_SENSOR_1_NAME, built
	  from source against this kernel and the vendor HDAL modules.

	  https://github.com/gtxaspec/novatek-sensors
